{
  "declaredLength": 5112,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡Únete a mis Nariáticos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100DA006E006500740065002000610020006D006900730020004E00610072006900E1007400690063006F00730021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos, no te hagas de rogar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F0073002C0020006E006F00200074006500200068006100670061007300200064006500200072006F0067006100720021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Impostor de poca monta.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006D0070006F00730074006F007200200064006500200070006F006300610020006D006F006E00740061002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Naria nunca diría algo así.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00610072006900610020006E0075006E00630061002000640069007200ED006100200061006C0067006F00200061007300ED002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je. No hay quien te engañe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002E0020004E006F002000680061007900200071007500690065006E00200074006500200065006E0067006100F10065002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero ¿a que es una buena forma de captar\nnuevos seguidores?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F002000BF0061002000710075006500200065007300200075006E00610020006200750065006E006100200066006F0072006D00610020006400650020006300610070007400610072000A006E007500650076006F00730020007300650067007500690064006F007200650073003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No necesitamos Nariaticuchos de pacotilla.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020006E0065006300650073006900740061006D006F00730020004E0061007200690061007400690063007500630068006F00730020006400650020007000610063006F00740069006C006C0061002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los únicos dignos de llamarnos Nariáticos somos\nlos que la amamos incondicionalmente.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te equivocas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100540065002000650071007500690076006F006300610073002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Al fin y al cabo, un fan es un fan, aunque no se\ndeje todo su dinero o tiempo en Naria.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uf... ¿En serio piensas aceptar a esa clase de\nfarsantes?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550066002E002E002E002000BF0045006E00200073006500720069006F0020007000690065006E0073006100730020006100630065007000740061007200200061002000650073006100200063006C006100730065002000640065000A00660061007200730061006E007400650073003F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Abuelo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041006200750065006C006F0021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Entiendo cómo se siente Inmita, pero no quiero\nque tengáis beef!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006E007400690065006E0064006F0020006300F3006D006F0020007300650020007300690065006E0074006500200049006E006D006900740061002C0020007000650072006F0020006E006F002000710075006900650072006F000A007100750065002000740065006E006700E100690073002000620065006500660021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tienes razón! ¡Además, las discusiones entre\nEntrenadores se zanjan con un buen combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pues adelante!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100500075006500730020006100640065006C0061006E0074006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068006F007200610020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿A qué esperas para combatir?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004100200071007500E9002000650073007000650072006100730020007000610072006100200063006F006D00620061007400690072003F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voy a demostrar mi amor de Nariática.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007900200061002000640065006D006F007300740072006100720020006D006900200061006D006F00720020006400650020004E00610072006900E10074006900630061002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No me gusta que mi abuelo haga lo que quiera,\npero me apetece combatir contra Inmita...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Paso más tiempo siendo Naria que ella, así que\nserá como luchar contra dos Narias.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nTremendo, ¿a que sí?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos allá!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300200061006C006C00E100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Esperad un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730070006500720061006400200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Eh, ahora no te acobardes! Ocasiones como\nesta no se dan todos los días.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me parece muy bien. ¡Sobre todo porque voy\na ganar yo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500200070006100720065006300650020006D007500790020006200690065006E002E002000A10053006F00620072006500200074006F0064006F00200070006F007200710075006500200076006F0079000A0061002000670061006E0061007200200079006F0021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Esperar a qué? ¿A morir de aburrimiento?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00450073007000650072006100720020006100200071007500E9003F002000BF00410020006D006F0072006900720020006400650020006100620075007200720069006D00690065006E0074006F003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Si os ganamos, todos vuestros amigos tendrán\nque volverse Nariáticos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Os mostraré mi amor de Nariática.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00730020006D006F0073007400720061007200E90020006D006900200061006D006F00720020006400650020004E00610072006900E10074006900630061002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Megaevoluciona para darles una megapaliza,\nEelektross! ¡Se van a llevar un buen chispazo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Adelante, Excadrill! ¡Megaevoluciona y enséñales\nde lo que eres capaz!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chandelure... ¡Megaevoluciona y muéstrales\nel poder de nuestro amor!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300680061006E00640065006C007500720065002E002E002E002000A1004D00650067006100650076006F006C007500630069006F006E0061002000790020006D007500E90073007400720061006C00650073000A0065006C00200070006F0064006500720020006400650020006E00750065007300740072006F00200061006D006F0072002100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yo soy una Nariática de verdad!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059006F00200073006F007900200075006E00610020004E00610072006900E100740069006300610020006400650020007600650072006400610064002100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Inmita...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E006D006900740061002E002E002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero también pienso que más gente debería\ndescubrir a Naria.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F002000740061006D0062006900E9006E0020007000690065006E0073006F00200071007500650020006D00E10073002000670065006E0074006500200064006500620065007200ED0061000A006400650073006300750062007200690072002000610020004E0061007200690061002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mis followers son importantes para mí, pero tú\nmás, Inmita.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069007300200066006F006C006C006F007700650072007300200073006F006E00200069006D0070006F007200740061006E007400650073002000700061007200610020006D00ED002C0020007000650072006F0020007400FA000A006D00E10073002C00200049006E006D006900740061002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias... ♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007200610063006900610073002E002E002E0020266500100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque engañar a la gente con un holograma no\nme parece bien.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410075006E00710075006500200065006E0067006100F100610072002000610020006C0061002000670065006E0074006500200063006F006E00200075006E00200068006F006C006F006700720061006D00610020006E006F000A006D006500200070006100720065006300650020006200690065006E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Ves, abuelo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005600650073002C00200061006200750065006C006F003F001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tomad, esto es para vosotr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas dos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F006D00610064002C0020006500730074006F0020006500730020007000610072006100200076006F0073006F0074007200100003110000FF0101006F0061007300200064006F0073002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Has recibido el Chándal de Naria de color\nalternativo.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007300200072006500630069006200690064006F00200065006C00200043006800E1006E00640061006C0020006400650020004E006100720069006100200064006500200063006F006C006F0072000A0061006C007400650072006E0061007400690076006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dicen que hay gente que hasta va a la peluquería\ny pide que le hagan mi peinado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uf... Quizá eso sea demasiado...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 4552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550066002E002E002E0020005100750069007A00E1002000650073006F0020007300650061002000640065006D00610073006900610064006F002E002E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡A seguir siendo tan buena fan, Inmita!\n¡Y en cuanto a ti, a ver si tú también te apuntas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 4628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con lo entrenados que tengo a mis Pokémon,\ny aun así me has ganado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 4820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006E0020006C006F00200065006E007400720065006E00610064006F00730020007100750065002000740065006E0067006F002000610020006D0069007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002C000A0079002000610075006E00200061007300ED0020006D00650020006800610073002000670061006E00610064006F002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seguiré creando artículos para atraer a más\nseguidores.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 4964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530065006700750069007200E900200063007200650061006E0064006F002000610072007400ED00630075006C006F0073002000700061007200610020006100740072006100650072002000610020006D00E10073000A007300650067007500690064006F007200650073002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Naria...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0061007200690061002E002E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
